# GitHub account for evals-bootcamp

This repo is owned by **angyb** (`https://github.com/angyb/evals-bootcamp`).

When running git or GitHub CLI commands here (push, pull, PRs, etc.):

1. Use the **angyb** GitHub account, not AngyBrooksZ.
2. Before pushing, confirm the active account: `gh auth status`
3. If needed, switch: `gh auth switch --user angyb`
4. Configure git credentials for that account: `gh auth setup-git`

Remote: `https://github.com/angyb/evals-bootcamp.git`
